WEBVTT

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:05.600
How are you doing, everyone? Furuichi here.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.930
Today I have come to the city and 
am spending a lovely time here.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.740
"Where's the big guy that's 
always around?" you ask?

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.710
I'm nobody's fool!

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.830
That's right! I won't make 
the same mistake again.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.370
Right about now...

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.120
...he should be carrying all the shopping!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.420
Now, it's time for city-boy 
Furuichi Takayuki's wonderful...

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:39.000
Furuichi-dono... What do 
you think of this bed?

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:47.810
You see, I mentioned that the bed we use at 
the moment is a tad narrow to your mother,

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.650
and she went and bought this for us!

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.320
The two of them? Wow...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.900
Kids these days sure have different tastes!

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:59.180
Now, let us try sleeping together on it!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.290
Furuichi-dono!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:49.020
<b>I've Quit Being the BoB Brawler!</b>

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.620
What the hell?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.790
Please, make us your underlings!

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:09.250
This first-year, Oga, has 
been on a tear lately!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:13.060
The other day he used Macao 
power to go on a rampage!

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:17.380
It was horrible, man! The combination of 
Macao and morning-glorys was... horrible!

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:21.880
So it was Oga that did this?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.220
Let's join together and take down Oga!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:29.190
Sorry, but I'm not interested 
in having underlings and stuff.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.630
Try someone else.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.170
Please!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.310
You're the only one left, Tojo-san!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.970
Fine, I get it. Do your best.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.700
Do our best? At what...?

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.280
Whatever, just... Try hard at stuff.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.880
Now scram.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.700
Right!

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.800
Hot...

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.560
Hot, hot, hot...

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:00.090
What the hell is with this freaky heat?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.780
The air conditioner isn't doing a damn thing.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.060
38 degrees?! Seriously?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:14.470
Is this that global warming thing?

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:18.710
At this rate the world'll be destroyed 
whether or not I deal with this Demon Lord thing.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.300
Good morning.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:24.220
It's hot! What the hell's with this room?

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.020
Good morning.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.200
Whoa, it's hot!

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.880
A summer cold?

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.740
That is how it seems.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.450
It's his fault?

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:42.500
Hey, Baby Beel... You hot? 
Have an ice cream pop...

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.950
Well, damn.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.750
Kids these days sure get all fired up.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.220
Did we have an ice pack somewhere?

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.150
Hey, is this gonna be okay?

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:58.550
The city isn't gonna end up flame 
broiled at this rate, right?

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:02.610
No need to worry. It is 
likely only temporary.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.030
It will pass if we cool him.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:06.950
However, the season is somewhat curious...

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.100
Season?

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.870
Furuichi!

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.400
You came just at the right time!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.180
I was just going to call you over.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.840
Look, Baby Beel's got a summer fever.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.780
Go find Tojo!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.550
Tojo?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.970
I'm about to go over the edge!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.100
Like, in all kinds of ways!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.250
My... My youth!

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:34.630
My very character!

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:37.610
Oh, if it isn't Takachin! Long time!

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:41.980
Didn't have an ice pack, but I did find this.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.340
An inflatable pool.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.440
We can cool him down by giving 
him an ice bath in this!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.040
Wait, that's just weird, Sis.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.340
I mean, it's not like we can use 
just anything to cool him down...

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:53.200
It's hot out, so maybe I'll get in myself.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.420
Hilda-chan, did you have a swimsuit?

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.350
No, I do not.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:00.760
Oh, then I'll lend you one of mine.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.030
But look, wait...

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:04.080
I'll blow it up!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.090
Hey, Furuichi...

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.120
Shut up!

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:08.540
How could you understand my suffering?

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.840
The beach is out, the highlands 
are out, the city is out...

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.680
If you destroy my reputation any more,

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.230
I can't be held responsible for my actions!

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.510
Sheesh...

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.560
What happened to the Tojo thing?

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.730
What are you doing, Oga? Help me!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.720
Just as one-sided as ever...

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:43.670
Well, these few aren't going to 
be a match for you, Tojo-san.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.690
What about the part-time job?

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:50.550
Well, after pinning 10 guys' arms 
down, they all came after me.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.550
<b>Arm Wrestling
1 100 Yen/Try</b>

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:53.910
You seem happy.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.610
Were they actually decently tough?

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.570
No, that's not it.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:02.980
It seems like Oga was making 
trouble again, Shoji.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.080
Just like the rumors say, he's tough.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:10.000
I can't wait!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.280
It's almost ready, Tatsumi!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.330
Sure.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.040
Boiling it instantly?

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.300
Sure there's fired up, 
but this is ridiculous!

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:30.420
He's not going to cool off like this...

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.050
No, no, no...

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.780
Not going to happen!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.720
Please, wait!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.970
Even if we can't cool him down, we 
could at least use it as a hot tub!

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:44.310
You wish for a hot bath, do you?

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.820
He's here!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.760
Then why don't we go to our house's bath?

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.440
I'll scrub your back for you!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.210
What was that about?

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.040
Anyway...

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.090
Is this really gonna be okay?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:18.870
Hey, what are you doing? 
The floor's sopping wet...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.510
The milk boiled instantly...

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.700
The room isn't hot anymore, yes?

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:29.770
It seems like the heat is 
no longer escaping his body.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.960
It has heated the inside of his 
body to incredible temperatures...

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.280
Is that a bad thing?

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.640
I don't know.

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.560
This has never happened before.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.480
He's telling us that he's still 
got another round in him!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.230
Master, I knew you had it in you!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:50.770
You do the name of Demon Lord proud!

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.460
He jumped!

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:58.600
What flowing footwork!

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:03.740
Hey, is he really okay?

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.840
Something is obviously wrong.

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.190
This is... The Zebel Spell is...

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.250
Master!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.710
His condition is far more 
serious than I thought.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.250
Serious?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.630
Look at your right hand.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.910
The Zebel Spell has disappeared.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.720
That proves that the link between 
you and the master has disappeared.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:42.060
In other words, even if he wanted to let out 
magic power, it has no where to go at the moment.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.990
Wait, seriously?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:50.060
Perhaps this high fever is because of that.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:54.990
That means no more god damn 
annoying shock sessions!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.530
So, can we cure him?

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.200
I don't know. Without understanding 
the reason for it...

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.640
Huh? It's not a summer cold?

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.530
That's what I had thought, however...

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.500
Will it get worse if we don't do anything?

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.050
I don't know!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:15.510
Well, it's not like he's 
gonna die. He's a Demon Lord!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.260
I told you, I don't know, damn it!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.010
Why're you yelling all of a sudden?

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.080
But, wait...

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:28.080
Doesn't this mean...?

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:32.650
Does this mean I'll be okay farther 
than 15 meters from him now?

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.710
Go off somewhere and vanish from this world!

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.450
What the hell was that for?

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:47.960
Get out.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.670
You disappoint me.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.550
Never come back here again!

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.540
That bitch, what the hell is 
she telling me to leave for?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.270
That ain't your house, you idiot!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:13.460
I mean, what's it to me if a 
Demon Lord or two kicks it?

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:15.820
And wait, isn't this is a good thing?

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.460
I feel so refreshed!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.630
Master...

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.180
Even if it costs me my 
life, I, Hilda, will...

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.340
Damn it!

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:41.050
Yo.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:52.350
What? Is that all you got, Oga Tatasumi?

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:58.240
That's not going to satisfy Tojo-san...

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:01.070
Who the hell are you?

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.330
Did you just say Tojo?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.990
Oh, you can stand? That's good, good...

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:29.770
It wouldn't be any fun otherwise, Oga-kun.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:33.810
That was close.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.360
Not bad, but you got a long way to go.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.400
That's it?

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.280
He's strong!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:58.210
Yes, this is Aizawa. How do you do?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.460
Yes. Yes...

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.500
Seriously?!

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.460
Roger that. I'll be right there.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:07.700
Sorry, I've got an emergency here...

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.830
Let's play again sometime.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.220
Wait!

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:14.350
What's your relationship to Tojo?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.710
His number one man, I suppose.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.230
See you later then.

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:23.980
I'm home...

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.670
That stupid woman...

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:33.630
Where the hell did she go, 
leaving Baby Beel here?

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.760
Man... And after she made such a fuss.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.470
Baby Beel?

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:08.750
Baby Beel and Hilda-san are gone?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.860
Yup. When I woke up this 
morning, not a sign of them.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:14.750
Not a sign? What are you going to do?

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:17.510
Huh? Nothing in particular.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.330
I mean, I'm better off without...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.500
Tatsumi!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.900
What the hell did you do?

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.810
Hilda-san and Baby Beel are gone, you say?

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:29.630
You'll never find a wife as 
good as her anywhere else!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.170
Sis...

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.570
You understand?

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:33.720
I'm telling you...

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.510
You obviously did something stupid, 
and she got fed up with you!

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:38.720
That's not it!

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.670
Hurry up and apologize!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.320
Why me too?

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:49.610
Listen up! Until you bring them back, 
I'm not letting you into the house!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:55.700
She's as tough as ever...

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.740
Damn it... I'm finally free, and...

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.580
Who the hell would go searching for them?

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.990
It's hot! Let's go to the river or something.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:09.920
The river?

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:16.930
So he <i>is</i> searching for them...

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.870
Tojo-san, speak of the devil.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.220
Oh, so you're Oga.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.630
You're thinner than I thought.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:48.510
It's finally time! Let's fight.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.360
That's Tojo...

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.780
And wait, isn't that Baby Beel?

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.640
Why is he on Tojo's back?

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.140
Oga's... getting pissed?

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:09.260
No, I can't tell...

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:12.400
This is basically like our wish come true...

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:16.240
He'll probably say something like "Lucky!"

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.430
Lucky!

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:22.510
Check it out, Furuichi-kun!

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:26.450
I don't know exactly why, but that 
brat is latched onto Tojo, my lad!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:27.930
My lad?

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.150
Now we're saved the trouble of 
pushing him off onto someone.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.250
We're going back!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.300
Go back where?

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:37.470
I mean I'm going home, of course!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.180
That's the river!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.770
Idiot! The river <i>is</i> home!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:42.730
What the hell are you...?

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.150
You're one funny bastard.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.850
This guy's a real piece of work, Shoji.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.620
I wonder...

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.700
I'm not going to stop you,

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:57.620
but I don't think he's really a person 
that'll be a good match for you, Tojo-san.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.370
Well, I look forward to finding out.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.010
Just calm down, okay?

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:07.630
You have to make sure first!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.770
Is Baby Beel really with Tojo now?

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:13.890
If you wanna freak out, do 
it after you've made sure!

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:17.010
I'm not freaking out, okay?

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.940
Tojo-san, can we ask you something?

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.050
Sure.

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:23.920
Is that baby on your back yours, Tojo-san?

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:28.610
Or did you just pick him up somewhere, 
and he's stuck to your back?

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:31.240
Oh, this guy?

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.920
Yeah...

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.490
I'll tell you if you beat me.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.140
Good. I can see it in your eyes.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.770
You're like me. You just like to fight.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:13.030
You're itching to fight with 
your full strength, yeah?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:16.230
But you're surrounded only by weaklings.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:20.450
There ain't anyone who could 
take you on at full power.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.450
That's how it is for me.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.290
Come at me however you want.

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:29.790
You're a crazy bastard...

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.540
Here I come!

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.770
Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:43.180
Don't tell me it's over already...

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.180
Oga got beat?

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.500
It's over.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:50.150
No one could stand after taking 
a full-on hit from you.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:03.330
Good. Wanna do it again?

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.720
Tojo-san!

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:21.820
Don't get excited.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:29.000
This has gotten interesting.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:33.550
Seriously? Tojo-san was knocked down?

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.150
I've never seen that happen before.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:39.140
Hey. You're the same, right?

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.120
You're pissin' me off...

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.240
Stop copying me!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.580
Oga, right? What's your first name?

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.100
Tatsumi! What's it to you?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:17.110
I see... Oga Tatasumi, is it?

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.240
The kid ain't mine.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:30.690
I picked him up yesterday. Dunno 
what happened, but he seemed lost.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:34.910
I figured I'd look after 
'im till I find his parents.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:39.130
I didn't ask you. Why are you answering?

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.400
Don't tell me that <i>you're</i> his father?

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.630
I told you... I didn't ask!

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:53.830
That's...

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.260
Zebel Spell!

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.520
I've gotta thank you, Oga Tatsumi.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.580
Thanks to you, I think I can 
actually go all out a little bit!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:05.490
Here I come!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:21.450
That's all he's got?

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:25.240
No-no-no... That was amazing, Tojo-san!

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:28.580
You punched him into the 
air like in some gag manga!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:33.410
Don't worry, he just fell in the river.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:40.680
Now, you there... Tell 
him this: "It was fun."

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.580
Shit!

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:45.240
Your pits sweat like I've never seen...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:06.670
And there you have it! Baby Beel's 
new dad is Tojo from the TKKH!

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:07.900
Isn't that nice, Oga?

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:10.050
No, it's not! I'm not 
going to let it end here!

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:12.400
I'm gonna beat the crap outta this Tojo guy!

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:14.800
There is only one way to save the master!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:18.680
But it is a way so dangerous, it 
risks your very life, Oga-dono!

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.180
Fine by me!

00:24:20.840 --> 00:24:23.490
On the next Beelzebub: 
The Doctor Has Arrived.

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:26.950
Wait a sec... If a doctor is here, 
did he bring a pretty nurse?
